# Machine-generated CAD / drawing exports. Their lines may carry significant
# trailing spaces (DXF linetype definitions, matplotlib SVG path data), so keep
# them byte-exact and out of text diffs / `git diff --check`, and never let Git
# rewrite their line endings.
*.brp -text -diff
*.step -text -diff
*.dxf -text -diff
*.svg -text -diff
*.sc -text -diff
*.stl -text -diff
*.3mf -text -diff
*.gif -text -diff
*.png -text -diff
